{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47950","headline":"掷裴武公诗 · 介胄鬼","name":"掷裴武公诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"屡策羸骖历乱峋，丛岚映日昼如曛。\n长桥驾险浮天汉，危栈通岐触岫云。\n却念淮阴空得计，又嗟忠武不堪闻。\n废兴尽系前生数，休衒英雄勇冠军。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"介胄鬼","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_47950.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_47950","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}